      },
      {
       "text": "Added the option to disable the Cockpit Flash Effect",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed Tourist achievement, 2 bases were not properly counted (land on any base for the achievement to update)",
