  {
   "id": "stellar-wanderer-dx-283577@1.0.2",
   "gameId": "stellar-wanderer-dx-283577",
   "displayName": "Hotfix 1.0.2",
   "kind": "hotfix",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2026-03-13T17:51:34.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "🛠️ Hotfix 1.0.2: HOTAS Support & Stability Improvements",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Hello pilots!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Thank you all for an incredible launch day! We apologize for the crash to desktop that occurred in the initial build, and we want to express our gratitude for your support, your reports are the reason why we were able to fix the bug so quickly!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Also, we have received a lot of great feedback and we plan to provide further stability and quality-of-life improvements in the coming days/weeks!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "For now we published 2 patches, latest being v1.0.2",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "🔄 v1.0.2 - HOTAS Support: Fixed an issue where HOTAS throttle axis input was not being processed.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "The game currently only supports single device HOTAS setups. We know our hardware support is incomplete, but we are committed to improving it. If your single-device setup isn't working—or if you'd like to see multi-device support in the future—please let us know in Community Hub.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "🔄 v1.0.1 - Resolved the crash to desktop that occurred shortly after launch.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "If you are still seeing crashes, please check if your game has updated to the latest version, sometimes it takes a while before Steam detects there is an update available.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "The Stellar Wanderer Team",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
